{"c":[{"name":"20261021T164029Z-dd6c62dffb711e78","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 raises BinderException for USING COMPRESSION zstd at storage v1.0.0 (1.5.4 stored it uncompressed silently); v1.2.0+ storage gives ZSTD. A zstd clause in 0001 breaks a schema-0 v1.0.0+ file and old-format test fixtures built from current 0001.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T170926Z-f865c4bcdda86174","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 bug: replaying a wal holding inserts into an HNSW-indexed table (killed 1.5.4 or 2.0 writer) breaks the index: query, delete, insert raise InternalException (flat or constant vector) or hang. 1.5.4 replays fine. DROP INDEX, CREATE INDEX, CHECKPOINT repairs.","type":"note"}]}
